"""
IRAM OS Sovereign Theme Studio & Visual Switcher (Enhanced)
===========================================================
High-performance Wayland/Hyprland theme selector with:
- 43 curated palettes (Modern Suite, Cyberpunk, Earth, Minimal OLED, Light)
- Live color swatches on every card (Background, Selection, Accent, Secondary, Tertiary)
- Instant live desktop preview mode (Hyprland window borders & Waybar acrylic)
- Theme wallpaper carousel & cycling inside the switcher
- Category filter pills with dynamic count badges
- Instant keyboard navigation (Arrows, Enter, Space, Tab, / for search, Esc)
"""

